DESCRIPTION:Back by popular demand\, Sean Gaskell features songs on the kor
 a - a melodic 21-string West African harp. Sean studied extensively under 
 master kora musicians in Gambia and Senegal and works to preserve the heri
 tage and culture of this melodic instrument.  https://grandcountyutah.net/
 calendar.aspx?EID=16791
